sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Sensor (máquina-03)
    participant M as Mosquitto
    participant P as Puente
    participant K as Kafka
    participant I as InfluxDB
    participant H as HDFS
    participant PD as Predictor
    participant G as Grafana
    S->>M: publish fabrica/maquina-03/lecturas (JSON)
    M->>P: entrega a suscriptores
    P->>K: produce clave=maquina-03 (acks=all)
    par Consumidores independientes
        K->>I: consumidor-influxdb (lotes de 500)
    and
        K->>H: consumidor-hdfs (1 archivo/min)
    and
        K->>PD: predictor (últimos 30 s)
        PD->>I: riesgo, alerta, anomalía
    end
    G->>I: consulta Flux cada 5 s
